					"content": "其實我用了些別的辦法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				},
				{
					"id": 4630540,
					"content": "嘿嘿，這點程度而已，當然不在話下啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4630543,
					"content": "#不管怎麼說，我認可{F#妳}{M#你}們的智慧，畢竟智慧本身是不會騙人的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
